    "summary": "Use it in either player's Fight phase or the opponent's Shooting phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick a **JAKHALS** or **GOREMONGERS** unit of yours that is a target of at least 1 of those attacks.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, its models have **[Feel No Pain 6+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)**, or **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** instead if your unit is either:\n\n- within 6\" of a friendly **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** unit\n- within 9\" of a friendly **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** unit",
